  <section>



      <h2 id="prevention">Flu vaccine</h2>









    <p data-block-key="6ef85">The flu vaccine helps protect against flu. It's safe and effective.</p><p data-block-key="70et2">It's offered on the NHS every year in autumn or early winter to some adults and children at higher risk of getting seriously ill from flu.</p>




